  r1,"yaml-frontend-compiles-into-explicit-nodes-and-deps","一个 workflow 声明两个 demand runs,其中 B 依赖 A",workflow 被编译为 Workflow IR,IR MUST 包含 A/B 两个节点
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"ctx-dependent-nodes-compile-only-when-ready",workflow node B 依赖 node A,workflow 执行,"系统 MUST 在 node A 完成并发布 ctx 后才物化编译 node B(compile-on-ready),并确保结果确定性不依赖并发完成时序"
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"ready-node-tie-break-does-not-depend-on-completion-timing",两个节点同时就绪且允许并发,多次运行同一 workflow,节点启动选择与最终 outcomes 对齐规则 MUST 稳定(可对拍)
