  r5,"workflow-ir-modules-import-under-python-3-6",运行时为 Python 3.6,导入 workflow IR 的核心模块(编译/调度/数据结构),系统 MUST 不因版本不兼容的语法/stdlib API 导致 `SyntaxError`/`ImportError`
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"options-are-present-in-compiled-ir",调用方通过 runtime entrypoints 提供 `workflow_runtime_options.resources_wait`,workflow 被编译为 Workflow IR,IR 的 `options` MUST 包含对应字段且值与该 runtime policy 等价
  r7,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r7,"output-staging-options-are-present-in-compiled-ir",workflow YAML 配置了 `workflow.options.output_staging`,workflow 被编译为 Workflow IR,IR 的 `options` MUST 包含对应 `output_staging` 字段且值与 YAML 配置等价